n-api-items.test.ts.\\nRun: npm test && npm run test:e2e to verify.\\n\\nFixture data: packages/web-ui/tests/fixtures/modules/core.yaml has test spec items.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #544. Replaced 217 lines of static analysis in tests/daemon-api-items.test.ts with 23 Playwright E2E tests in packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-items.spec.ts. All ACs (ac-8 through ac-11) covered with real HTTP calls against running daemon. All CI checks passed.\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 2,\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"testing\",\n      \"daemon\",\n      \"e2e\"\n    ],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJBS56Y7BX7RKGTH9T6MKRYG\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T00:28:39.737Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-02-26T02:26:06.286Z\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2026-02-26T02:39:56.285Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-26T03:34:26.228Z\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJBX0WRB668M1VT0RGTEPA22\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T02:39:06.507Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"Written packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-items.spec.ts with 23 Playwright E2E tests covering @api-contract ac-8 through ac-11. Tests use daemon fixture for real HTTP calls. Deleted tests/daemon-api-items.test.ts (217 lines of static analysis). Unit test run skipped due to cgroup PID limit (2020/2048) in sandbox — identical pattern to previous task which passed CI.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJBNJ3QWS882SPWM83DDVXJM\",\n    \"slugs\": [\n      \"task-e2e-daemon-inbox-api\"\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"E2E tests for daemon Inbox API (replace daemon-api-inbox.test.ts)\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"descriptio