for child tasks  603ms\\n     ✓ should use existing parent task for depends_on  952ms\\n     ✓ should skip existing tasks without --force  583ms\\n     ✓ should handle partial derivation (some children have tasks)  556ms\\n     ✓ should add implementation notes from spec description  550ms\\n     ✓ should add implementation notes with acceptance criteria  804ms\\n     ✓ should not add empty notes when spec has no description or ACs  791ms\\n     ✓ should exclude cancelled parent tasks from depends_on  771ms\\n     ✓ should use non-cancelled parent task when multiple tasks exist  1062ms\\n     ✓ should allow re-derivation when only cancelled tasks exist  849ms\\n     ✓ should use --title override instead of default title  330ms\\n     ✓ should display AC count in derive output  695ms\\n     ✓ should display AC count in dry-run output  496ms\\n     ✓ should include ac_count in JSON output  814ms\\n     ✓ should show complexity warning for specs with >5 ACs  1153ms\\n     ✓ should show complexity warning in dry-run for specs with >5 ACs  1271ms\\n     ✓ should show Quick Commands for active task  333ms\\n     ✓ should add acceptance criterion with auto-generated ID  319ms\\n     ✓ should add acceptance criterion with custom ID  322ms\\n     ✓ should reject duplicate AC ID  319ms\\n     ✓ should update acceptance criterion  488ms\\n     ✓ should remove acceptance criterion  631ms\\n     ✓ should handle YAML special characters correctly  485ms\\n     ✓ should auto-increment AC IDs correctly  621ms\\n     ✓ should return JSON output  312ms\\n     ✓ should show dry-run output without deleting  641ms\\n     ✓ should delete task with --force  658ms\\n     ✓ should show derive hint after item set  320ms\\n     ✓ should show AC count in alignment guidance for task with spec_ref  987ms\\n     ✓ should show spec context when starting task with spec_ref  795ms\\n     ✓ should not show spec context when starting task without spec_ref  330ms\\n     ✓ should suppress spec context in