,\n        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: CI check-unresolved-comments is FAILING due to 3 unresolved GitHub review threads from prior Codex review. The code fixes were applied in commit 6e045e45 but the threads were never resolved in GitHub. Worker must resolve the 3 threads: (1) api-errors.spec.ts:153 ac-23 422 test thread, (2) api-projects.spec.ts ac-5/6/7 annotation thread, (3) api-projects.spec.ts POST test structure suggestion. Code is correct — only GitHub thread resolution needed.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJBNJCYDTFHTDB60DJFM1356\",\n    \"slugs\": [\n      \"task-e2e-daemon-server-core\"\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"E2E tests for daemon Server core (replace daemon-server.test.ts)\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"Replace tests/daemon-server.test.ts (310 lines) with Playwright E2E tests. Currently all static analysis except the localhost middleware unit tests (lines 59-188).\\n\\nWrite: packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-server.spec.ts\\nUsing: daemon fixture from tests/fixtures/test-base.ts\\n\\nBehaviors to test:\\n- GET /api/health — verify response shape {status: 'ok', uptime, connections, version} (@daemon-server ac-11)\\n- CORS headers — fetch from test, verify Access-Control-Allow-Origin includes localhost:5173 (@daemon-server ac-15, @api-contract ac-1)\\n- Verify daemon is only accessible on localhost (the middleware unit tests at lines 59-188 are already behavioral — move them to a vitest file like tests/daemon-localhost-middleware.test.ts, or keep them in the same file with only the behavioral tests) (@daemon-server ac-3)\\n\\nFor the static tests being deleted (ac-1 Elysia dep, ac-2 hostname binding, ac-12 signal handlers): these are verified implicitly — if the daemon starts and responds to health checks, it's bound correctly. Signal handler shutdown